  "id": "turkey-and-bacon-panini",
  "name": "Turkey and Bacon Panini",
  "subtitle": "Pressed focaccia with smoky chipotle mayonnaise",
  "description": "Layer crisp bacon, savory spinach, turkey, and provolone in focaccia, then press until the bread is golden and the cheese is melted.",
